        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "This regulation provides that Part 2 PCR 2015 applies to certain public service contracts for research and development services if:",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [
        "Research and development services",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "the services are funded entirely by the contracting authority awarding the contract, and",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [
        "Research and development services",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00005",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "the benefits of the research and development are received exclusively by the contracting authority for use in the conduct of its own affairs.",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "heading_path": [
        "Research and development services",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00006",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Objective at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "heading_path": [
        "Research and development services",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00007",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Part 2 PCR will not apply to any contracts referred to in this regulation (i.e. regulation 14).",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "heading_path": [
        "Research and development services",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00008",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Key considerations at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "heading_path": [
        "Research and development services",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00009",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Contracting authorities should:",
      "ordinal": 9,
      "heading_path": [
        "Research and development services",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00010",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "ensure the subject-matter and circumstances of any research and development contract are reviewed and consideration is given as to whether this regulation (i.e. regulation 14) will apply.",
      "ordinal": 10,
      "heading_path": [
        "Research and development services",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
